==English==
===Noun===
'''ambos'''

# {{plural of|[[ambo]]}}

'''Ambos'''

# Ambos Designs is a clothing company based in Boulder Colorado. The two founders design locally and collaborate with artisans around the world to create beautiful, unique and socially conscious apparel. The word Ambos, meaning “both” in Spanish, describes the fusion of two cultures. Ambos Designs achieves an elegant balance of tradition and style in each piece of distinctive clothing.
Currently, Ambos Designs works with Mayan women’s cooperatives and individual artisans in Guatemala to produce hand crafted jewelry, leather belts, intricate beaded jewelry, natural dyes, and hand-woven fabrics. Each of our projects aim to provide fair wages and valuable work opportunity artisans, both locally and abroad.

